+# Aegis — Secrets, Rekor, Secure Aggregation, Gatekeeper, Edge & Observability Patch
+
+This patch codifies production-ready work in the following areas:
+
+- Secrets & Key Management
+  - Terraform (terraform/aws/vault_kms_s3.tf) to provision AWS KMS + S3 for auto-unseal and artifact storage.
+  - tools/install_vault_helm_aws.sh to deploy Vault Helm chart with auto-unseal on AWS KMS.
+  - tools/migrate_cosign_to_vault.sh to move existing cosign keys into Vault KV (or use Transit).
+  - services/signing/receipt_signer_vault.py: a signing service that calls Vault Transit and writes Rekor entries.
+  - .github/workflows/ci_sign_and_attest.yml: CI example that uploads artifact to S3, calls receipt_signer to sign/attest.
+
+- Rekor (non-repudiable attestation)
+  - k8s/rekor/rekor-deployment.yaml: simple Rekor deployment (use persistent storage and TLS in production).
+  - receipt_signer_vault posts to Rekor; CI archives attestation.json produced by signer.
+
+- Federated secure aggregation & DP
+  - services/federated/secure_aggregation.py: prototype coordinator implementing additive masking protocol (educational).
+  - services/federated/client_masked_stub.py: client demo to submit masked updates.
